#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now that <application>qt5</application> updates are restricted to commercial"
" customers, upstream patches for the various modules are being curated at "
"kde.  Patches for the modules required by packages in BLFS have been "
"aggregated for the non-modular qt5 build we use."
msgstr ""
"Agora que as atualizações do <application>qt5</application> estão restritas "
"a clientes comerciais, os remendos de fluxo de desenvolvimento para os "
"vários módulos estão sendo selecionados no KDE. Os remendos para os módulos "
"exigidos pelos pacotes no BLFS foram agregados para a construção do qt5 não "
"modular que usamos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Required patch: <ulink url=\"&patch-root;/qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-kf5-1.patch\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Remendo exigido: <ulink url=\"&patch-root;/qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-kf5-1.patch\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Details of the kde curation can be found at <ulink "
"url=\"https://dot.kde.org/2021/04/06/announcing-kdes-qt-5-patch-"
"collection\"/> and <ulink "
"url=\"https://community.kde.org/Qt5PatchCollection\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Detalhes da curadoria do KDE podem ser encontrados em <ulink "
"url=\"https://dot.kde.org/2021/04/06/announcing-kdes-qt-5-patch-"
"collection\"/> e <ulink "
"url=\"https://community.kde.org/Qt5PatchCollection\"/>."

