#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid "Setting the installation prefix"
msgstr "Configurando o prefixo de instalação"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:159
#, xml-text
msgid "Installing in /opt/qt5"
msgstr "Instalando em /opt/qt5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The BLFS editors recommend installing <application>qt5</application> in a "
"directory other than <filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, i.e.  "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename>.  To do this, set the "
"following environment variable:"
msgstr ""
"Os(As) editores(as) do BLFS recomendam instalar o "
"<application>qt5</application> em um diretório diferente de <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, ou seja, <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> . Para fazer isso, configure a "
"seguinte variável de ambiente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:168
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>export QT5PREFIX=/opt/qt5</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>export QT5PREFIX=/opt/qt5</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the installation paths are hardcoded into installed files.  This "
"is the reason why <filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> is used "
"as installation prefix instead of <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/qt-&qt5-version;</filename>. To create a versioned "
"<application>qt5</application> directory after the installation is complete,"
" you may rename the directory and create a symlink:"
msgstr ""
"Ocasionalmente, os caminhos de instalação estão rigidamente codificados nos "
"arquivos instalados. Essa é a razão pela qual <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> é usado como prefixo de instalação "
"em vez de <filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt-&qt5-version;</filename>. "
"Para criar um diretório versionado do <application>qt5</application> depois "
"que a instalação estiver completa, você pode renomear o diretório e criar um"
" link simbólico:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:180
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /opt/qt-&qt5-version;\n"
"ln -sfnv qt-&qt5-version; /opt/qt5</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /opt/qt-&qt5-version;\n"
"ln -sfnv qt-&qt5-version; /opt/qt5</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:184
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Later on, you may want to install other versions of "
"<application>qt5</application>. To do that, just remove the symlink and use "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> as the prefix again. Which"
" version of <application>qt5</application> you use depends only on where the"
" symlink points."
msgstr ""
"Mais tarde, você pode querer instalar outras versões do "
"<application>qt5</application>. Para fazer isso, apenas remova o link "
"simbólico e use <filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> como o "
"prefixo novamente. Qual versão do <application>qt5</application> você usa "
"depende somente de onde o link simbólico aponta."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:195
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of qt5"
msgstr "Instalação do qt5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:199
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <application>qt5</application> is being reinstalled into the same "
"directory as an existing instance, run the commands done by &root;, such as "
"<command>make install</command>, from a console or non-qt5 based window "
"manager. It overwrites <application>qt5</application> libraries that should "
"not be in use during the install process."
msgstr ""
"Se <application>qt5</application> estiver sendo reinstalado no mesmo "
"diretório de uma instância existente, execute os comandos feitos por &root;,"
" como <command>make install</command>, a partir de um console ou de um "
"gerenciador de janelas não baseado em qt5. Ela sobrescreve bibliotecas do "
"<application>qt5</application> que não deveriam estar em uso durante o "
"processo de instalação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><caution><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:210
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you did not install some of the recommended dependencies, examine "
"<command>./configure --help</command> output to check how to disable them or"
" use internal versions bundled in the source tarball."
msgstr ""
"Se você não instalou alguma das dependências recomendadas, examine a saída "
"gerada de <command>./configure --help</command> para verificar como "
"desabilitá-las ou para usar versões internas incluídas no tarball do fonte."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:218
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The BLFS editors do not recommend installing <application>qt5</application> "
"into the <filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> hierarchy because it "
"becomes difficult to find components and to update to a new version.  If you"
" do want to install <application>qt5</application> in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, the directories need to be specified "
"explicitly.  In this case, set <envar>QT5PREFIX=/usr</envar> and add the "
"following to the configure arguments below:"
msgstr ""
"Os(As) editores(as) do BLFS não recomendam instalar "
"<application>qt5</application> na hierarquia <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> porque se torna difícil encontrar "
"componentes e atualizar para uma nova versão. Se você realmente quiser "
"instalar <application>qt5</application> no <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, os diretórios precisam ser "
"especificados explicitamente. Nesse caso, configure "
"<envar>QT5PREFIX=/usr</envar> e adicione o seguinte aos argumentos de "
"configuração abaixo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:229
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>            -archdatadir    /usr/lib/qt5                \\\n"
"            -bindir         /usr/bin                    \\\n"
"            -plugindir      /usr/lib/qt5/plugins        \\\n"
"            -importdir      /usr/lib/qt5/imports        \\\n"
"            -headerdir      /usr/include/qt5            \\\n"
"            -datadir        /usr/share/qt5              \\\n"
"            -docdir         /usr/share/doc/qt5          \\\n"
"            -translationdir /usr/share/qt5/translations \\\n"
"            -examplesdir    /usr/share/doc/qt5/examples</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>            -archdatadir    /usr/lib/qt5                \\\n"
"            -bindir         /usr/bin                    \\\n"
"            -plugindir      /usr/lib/qt5/plugins        \\\n"
"            -importdir      /usr/lib/qt5/imports        \\\n"
"            -headerdir      /usr/include/qt5            \\\n"
"            -datadir        /usr/share/qt5              \\\n"
"            -docdir         /usr/share/doc/qt5          \\\n"
"            -translationdir /usr/share/qt5/translations \\\n"
"            -examplesdir    /usr/share/doc/qt5/examples</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:241
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, apply a patch to pull in the fixes curated by KDE for those modules "
"which are required by packages mentioned in this book:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, aplique um remendo para obter as correções selecionadas pelo KDE "
"para aqueles módulos que sejam exigidos pelos pacotes mencionados neste "
"livro:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:245
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-kf5-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-kf5-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:248
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The patch is supposed to be used in a git repository. If it isn't, some "
"files that should be modified by <command>configure</command> after applying"
" the patch are not touched. Fortunately, it is enough to create a <filename "
"class=\"directory\">.git</filename> directory in the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">qmake</filename> directory where the "
"<command>configure</command> script is run:"
msgstr ""
"Presume-se que o remendo seja usado em um repositório git. Se ele não for, "
"alguns arquivos que deveriam ser modificados pelo "
"<command>configure</command> depois de aplicar-se o remendo não seriam "
"tocados. Felizmente, é suficiente criar um diretório <filename "
"class=\"directory\">.git</filename> no diretório <filename "
"class=\"directory\">qmake</filename> onde o conjunto de comandos sequenciais"
" <command>configure</command> for executado:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:256
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir -pv qtbase/.git</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir -pv qtbase/.git</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:259
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"At this point we want to set up skipping most components.  Do that with:"
msgstr ""
"Neste ponto, queremos configurar o salto da maioria dos componentes. Faça "
"isso com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:262
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ls -Fd qt* | grep / | sed 's/^/-skip /;s@/@@' > tempconf &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i -r '/base|tools|x11extras|svg|declarative|wayland/d' tempconf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ls -Fd qt* | grep / | sed 's/^/-skip /;s@/@@' > tempconf &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i -r '/base|tools|x11extras|svg|declarative|wayland/d' tempconf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:266
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to install the <xref linkend='NetworkManager'/> examples, run: "
"<command>sed -i '/qtdoc/d' tempconf</command>."
msgstr ""
"Se você desejar instalar os exemplos <xref linkend='NetworkManager'/>, "
"execute: <command>sed -i '/qtdoc/d' tempconf</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:271
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you choose to not install <xref linkend='qt6'/> and want to use qt5 with "
"wireshark, run: <command>sed -i '/qtmultimedia/d' tempconf</command>."
msgstr ""
"Se você escolher não instalar <xref linkend='qt6'/> e quiser usar qt5 com "
"wireshark, execute: <command>sed -i '/qtmultimedia/d' tempconf</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:276
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now, install <application>qt5</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, instale <application>qt5</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
