"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;Debugger;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:411
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some packages such as <xref linkend='vlc'/> look for certain executables "
"with a -qt5 suffix.  Run the following command as the &root; user to create "
"the necessary symlinks:"
msgstr ""
"Alguns pacotes, como <xref linkend='vlc'/>, procuram determinados "
"executáveis com um sufixo -qt5. Execute o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &root; para criar os necessários links simbólicos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:416
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>for file in moc uic rcc qmake lconvert lrelease lupdate; do\n"
"  ln -sfvn $QT5BINDIR/$file /usr/bin/$file-qt5\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>for file in moc uic rcc qmake lconvert lrelease lupdate; do\n"
"  ln -sfvn $QT5BINDIR/$file /usr/bin/$file-qt5\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:423
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:426
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-confirm-license</parameter>: Accept license without prompting "
"user during configuration."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-confirm-license</parameter>: Aceita a licença sem avisar o(a) "
"usuário(a) durante a configuração."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:431
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-opensource</parameter>: Install the opensource version of "
"<application>qt</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-opensource</parameter>: Instala a versão de fonte aberto do "
"<application>qt</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:436
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-nomake examples</parameter>: This switch disables building of "
"the example programs included in the source tarball. Remove it if you want "
"to build them."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-nomake examples</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita construir os "
"programas de exemplo incluídos no tarball do fonte. Remova-a se você quiser "
"construí-los."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:443
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-system-sqlite</parameter>: This switch enables use of the system"
" version of <application>SQLite</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-system-sqlite</parameter>: Essa chave habilita uso da versão do "
"sistema do <application>SQLite</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:448
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-system-harfbuzz</parameter>: This switch enables use of the "
"system version of <application>Harfbuzz</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-system-harfbuzz</parameter>: Essa chave habilita uso da versão "
"do sistema do <application>Harfbuzz</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:453
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-dbus-linked</parameter> <parameter>-openssl-linked</parameter>: "
"These switches enable explicit linking of the "
"<application>D-Bus</application> and <application>OpenSSL</application> "
"libraries into <application>qt5</application> libraries instead of "
"<command>dlopen()</command>-ing them."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-dbus-linked</parameter> <parameter>-openssl-linked</parameter>: "
"Essas chaves habilitam vinculação explícita das bibliotecas do "
"<application>D-Bus</application> e do <application>OpenSSL</application> nas"
" bibliotecas do <application>qt5</application> em vez de abri-las com "
"<command>dlopen()</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:463
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-syslog</parameter>: This switch allows to send qt messages to "
"the <command>syslog</command> logging system."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-syslog</parameter>: Essa chave permite enviar mensagens qt para "
"o sistema de registro <command>syslog</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:468
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-journald</parameter>: This switch allows to send qt messages to "
"the <command>journald</command> logging system."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-journald</parameter>: Essa chave permite enviar mensagens qt "
"para o sistema de registro <command>journald</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:473
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>$(cat tempconf)</command>: This command provides a list of "
"components that should not be built. These entries are in the form of "
"\"-skip &lt;component&gt;\"."
msgstr ""
"<command>$(cat tempconf)</command>: Esse comando fornece uma lista de "
"componentes que não deveriam ser construídos. Essas entradas estão no "
"formato \"-skip &lt;componente&gt;\"."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:481
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring qt5"
msgstr "Configurando qt5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:484
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:487
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref linkend=\"sudo\"/> is installed, QT5DIR should be available to the "
"super user as well. Execute the following commands as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"sudo\"/> estiver instalado, QT5DIR também deveria estar "
"disponível para o(a) superusuário(a). Execute os seguintes comandos como "
"o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:492
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sudoers.d/qt &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>Defaults env_keep += QT5DIR</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sudoers.d/qt &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>Defaults env_keep += QT5DIR</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:496
#, xml-text
msgid "If you installed qt5 in /usr"
msgstr "Se você instalou qt5 em /usr"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:499
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you installed <application>qt5</application> in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, create an environment variable needed "
"by certain packages.  As the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou <application>qt5</application> em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, crie uma variável de ambiente "
"necessária para certos pacotes. Como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:505
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh\n"
"\n"
"QT5DIR=/usr\n"
"export QT5DIR\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh\n"
"\n"
"QT5DIR=/usr\n"
"export QT5DIR\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:514
#, xml-text
msgid "If you did not install qt5 in /usr"
msgstr "Se você não instalou qt5 em /usr"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:517
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you installed <application>qt5</application> in a location other than "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, you need to update the "
"following configuration files so that <application>qt5</application> is "
"correctly found by other packages and system processes."
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou <application>qt5</application> em um local diferente de "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, você precisa atualizar os "
"seguintes arquivos de configuração, de forma que "
"<application>qt5</application> seja encontrado corretamente por outros "
"pacotes e processos do sistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:524
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, update the "
"<filename>/etc/ld.so.conf</filename> file and the dynamic linker's run-time "
"cache file:"
msgstr ""
"Como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, "
"atualize o arquivo <filename>/etc/ld.so.conf</filename> e o arquivo de cache"
" de tempo de execução do vinculador dinâmico:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:529
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/ld.so.conf &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal># Begin Qt addition\n"
"\n"
"/opt/qt5/lib\n"
"\n"
"# End Qt addition</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"ldconfig</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/ld.so.conf &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal># Begin Qt addition\n"
"\n"
"/opt/qt5/lib\n"
"\n"
"# End Qt addition</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"ldconfig</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:540
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/ld.so.conf"
msgstr "/etc/ld.so.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:544
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the &root; user, create the <filename>/etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</filename> "
"file:"
msgstr ""
"Como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, crie o arquivo "
"<filename>/etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</filename>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:547
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/qt_5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/qt_5.sh\n"
"\n"
"QT5DIR=/opt/qt5\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/bin           PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/lib/pkgconfig PKG_CONFIG_PATH\n"
"\n"
"export QT5DIR\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/profile.d/qt_5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/qt_5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/qt_5.sh\n"
"\n"
"QT5DIR=/opt/qt5\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/bin           PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/lib/pkgconfig PKG_CONFIG_PATH\n"
"\n"
"export QT5DIR\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/profile.d/qt_5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:565
#, xml-text
